{"speciesId":107,"names":{"fr":"Tygnon","es":"Hitmonchan","en":"Hitmonchan","ja":"エビワラー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning fast volleys that are impossible to see."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning fast volleys that are impossible to see."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Punches in cork­ screw fashion. It can punch its way through a concrete wall in the same way as a drill."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its punches slice the air. They are launched at such high speed, even a slight graze could cause a burn."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"To increase the strength of all its punch moves, it spins its arms just before making contact."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working towards a world championship. This POKéMON has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working towards a world championship. This POKéMON has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A HITMONCHAN is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who aimed to become the world champion. Having an indomitable spirit means that it will never give up."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"The spirit of a pro boxer has infused this POKéMON. It throws punches that are faster than a bullet train."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"While apparently doing nothing, it fires punches in lightning-fast volleys that are impossible to see."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its punches slice the air. However, it seems to need a short break after fighting for three minutes."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its punches slice the air. They are launched at such high speed, even a slight graze could cause a burn."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Même le béton cède sous ses poings dévastateurs. Au combat, il s’essouffle au bout de 3 minutes."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Même le béton cède sous ses poings dévastateurs. Au combat, il s’essouffle au bout de 3 minutes."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Même le béton cède sous ses poings dévastateurs. Au combat, il s’essouffle au bout de trois minutes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Los potentes golpes de sus brazos pueden pulverizar el hormigón. Descansa tras luchar tres minutos."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The arm-twisting punches it throws pulverize even concrete. It rests after three minutes of fighting."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"腕を ねじりながら 繰り出す パンチは コンクリートも 粉砕。 ３分 戦うと ひとやすみする。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Tygnon possède l’esprit combatif des plus grands champions de boxe. Ses coups de poing partent plus vite qu’un boulet de canon."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Dicen que tiene el alma de un boxeador profesional. Da puñetazos a la velocidad del rayo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The spirit of a pro boxer has infused this Pokémon. It throws punches that are faster than a bullet train."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"プロボクサーの 魂が 乗り移っている。パンチの スピードは 新幹線よりも 速い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On raconte que Tygnon dispose de l’état d’esprit d’un boxeur qui s’entraîne pour le championnat du monde. Ce Pokémon est doté d’une ténacité à toute épreuve et n’abandonne jamais face à l’adversité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dicen que Hitmonchan tiene el mismo ímpetu que un boxeador entrenándose para un campeonato mundial. Este Pokémon tiene un espíritu indomable que nunca se doblega ante la adversidad."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Hitmonchan is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working toward a world championship. This Pokémon has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"世界チャンピオンを 目指していた ボクサーの 魂が 宿ったと いわれる エビワラーは 不屈の 精神で 絶対に へこたれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On raconte que Tygnon dispose de l’état d’esprit d’un boxeur qui s’entraîne pour le championnat du monde. Ce Pokémon est doté d’une ténacité à toute épreuve et n’abandonne jamais face à l’adversité."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dicen que Hitmonchan tiene el mismo ímpetu que un boxeador entrenándose para un campeonato mundial. Este Pokémon tiene un espíritu indomable que nunca se doblega ante la adversidad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Hitmonchan is said to possess the spirit of a boxer who had been working toward a world championship. This Pokémon has an indomitable spirit and will never give up in the face of adversity."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"世界チャンピオンを 目指していた ボクサーの 魂が 宿ったと いわれる エビワラーは 不屈の 精神で 絶対に へこたれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Ses coups de poing rotatifs sont si puissants qu’ils peuvent percer le béton comme une foreuse."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Sus puñetazos, semejantes a una taladradora, pueden perforar un muro de hormigón como si nada."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Punches in corkscrew fashion. It can punch its way through a concrete wall like a drill."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"ねじり込むような パンチ攻撃！ コンクリートの壁が ドリル状に 削られて やがて 穴が あく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Ses coups de poing rotatifs sont si puissants qu’ils peuvent percer le béton comme une foreuse."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Sus puñetazos, semejantes a una taladradora, pueden perforar un muro de hormigón como si nada."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Punches in corkscrew fashion. It can punch its way through a concrete wall like a drill."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"ねじり込むような パンチ攻撃！ コンクリートの壁が ドリル状に 削られて やがて 穴が あく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses poings fendent l’air. Ils sont si rapides qu’un simple frôlement peut causer une brûlure."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sus puñetazos cortan el aire. Son tan veloces que el mínimo roce podría causar una quemadura."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its punches slice the air. They are launched at such high speed, even a slight graze could cause a burn."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"空気を 切り裂く パンチ。 かすっただけで 火傷に なるほど パンチの スピードは 速いのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses poings fendent 